            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0270" n="176" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg176"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">314.0022/4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Jorge Ubico to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1930-12-15">undated</date>.]<lb/>[Received
                        December 15, 1930—3:10 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Greatly obliged. Express my highest esteem for United States on the occasion of
                    your very opportune protection.</p>
                <p>Sincerely your friend,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">General Jorge
                    Ubico</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
